<title>USA: Austin, Texas, $30.6 mln deal won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Austin, Texas, $30.6 mln deal won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Thursday it won $30.6 million Austin, Texas, limited tax bonds at a true interest cost of 5.713 percent.</p>
